      "title": "Concrete edits",
      "items": [
        "Text: customer_name \"Ada\" becomes \"ADA\". Any cell may become SQL NULL.",
        "An application policy may set email to NULL and filter rows with retain_rows.",
        "No inserted rows, schema changes or reordering of retained rows are allowed."
      ]
