      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Classification is optional evidence",
      "items": [
        "Raw output lineage and optional column classifications are provided to the callback.",
        "Unavailable classification remains explicit. Application hooks interpret it; mandatory engine masking remains planned."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Failure and cache behavior",
      "items": [
        "An invalid or failed batch is rejected without sending its raw fallback. Earlier chunks cannot be retracted.",
